{"id":"surface","lemma":"surface","pos":"noun","rank":1633,"glosses":["surface"],"ipa":"/syʁ.fas/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/9e/Fr-surface.ogg/Fr-surface.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"surfaces"},"formAudio":{"surfaces":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/9f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-WikiLucas00-surfaces.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"La surface de la lune est irrégulière.","en":"The surface of the moon is irregular.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,null,null,{"g":"the Moon"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"irregular","l":"irrégulier"}],"phrases":[[2,4,"of the"]]},{"text":"La surface de cette table est lisse.","en":"This table's surface is smooth.","words":[{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"table"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"smooth"}]},{"text":"Je ne suis pas sûr de quand il va faire surface.","en":"I'm not sure when he'll turn up.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"am","l":"être"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"sure, certain"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"when"},{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to go","l":"aller"},{"g":"to do"},null]},{"text":"Elle a coulé sous la surface de l'eau.","en":"She sank under the surface of the water.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to sink","l":"couler"},{"g":"below, under"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"}]},{"text":"Les pétales flottaient sur la surface de l'eau.","en":"The petals floated on the surface of the water.","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"petal","l":"pétale"},{"g":"to float","l":"flotter"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"water"}]}]}